      "lines": [
        "202. 周长等于$p\\,\\mathrm{cm}$、面积等于$S\\,\\mathrm{cm}^2$的矩形存在吗？",
        "设：",
        "а) $p=40,S=84$；б) $p=40,S=105$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "203",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "203. а) 方程$x^2+x+y=30$的图象经过两坐标的和等于5的",
        "点. 求这个点的坐标.",
        "б) 方程$x^2+4y=20$的图象经过纵坐标为横坐标的两",
        "倍的点. 求这个点的坐标."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "12. 给出数列的方法"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 有限数列可按它的项的序号递增的顺序列出它的项",
        "的方法给出."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例如，这样给出数列$(a_n)$：",
        "$1,4,9,16,25,36,49,64,81,100$.　$(1)$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这种情况实际上就是利用给出函数的列表法. 其实，上面的",
        "$(1)$行就是下表的简略写法："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "表",
      "box": [
        322,
        2257,
        1758,
        402
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "tbl-p0081-01"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 数列可以用说明的方法给出"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "举例说，设已知数列$(c_n)$的项是按递增的顺序取的小于",
        "20的质数. 通过这个说明，很容易求出$c_1=2$，$c_2=3$，$c_3=5$，",
        "$c_4=7$，$c_5=11$，$c_6=13$，$c_7=17$，$c_8=19$."
      ]
    },
